# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 4, gaming; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=vulkan-icd-loader
pkgver=1.4.313.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="The Vulkan loader (libvulkan): finds the GPU drivers for programs"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Loader"
license=(Apache-2.0)
depends=(glibc libx11 libxcb libxrandr wayland)
source=("https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Loader/archive/vulkan-sdk-$pkgver/Vulkan-Loader-vulkan-sdk-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    cmake -S Vulkan-Loader-vulkan-sdk-$pkgver -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \
        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib -DCMAKE_INSTALL_SYSCONFDIR=/etc -DCMAKE_INSTALL_DATADIR=share \
        -DBUILD_TESTS=OFF -DBUILD_WSI_XCB_SUPPORT=ON -DBUILD_WSI_XLIB_SUPPORT=ON -DBUILD_WSI_WAYLAND_SUPPORT=ON -DBUILD_WSI_XLIB_XRANDR_SUPPORT=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
